70050000029037.description:
SOMEONE ELSE WILL DO IT...
After defeating the bad guy, you realized that your actions left the three world of Halargian in total disarray...
You should keep working to fix everything, but you're too lazy... And beside, you already did so much for these worlds!

LET'S PLAY GOD!
Gather forbidden knowledges and summon a group of real heroes to do your job!
What could go wrong? Right?

"DAMSELS & DRAGONS" FETURES:
- 3 new playable characters that can be added to your team;
- 3 new big adventure, each tied to one of the world of Halargian;
- 9 new uncharted islands, with unique biomes and features;
- 20+ new monsters to fight;
- 4 new challenging bosses;
- 6 new epic level weapons, helms and armors;
- 2 new crafting matherial for creating the ultimate equipment!

70050000043320.description:
Discover the most secretive underground racing arena in the world of Hot Wheels™, where the Teku and Metal Maniacs train to compete in the World Race. Welcome to the AcceleDrome! Inside Dr. Tezla's headquarters, you can experience all the thrills of racing and the adventures of AcceleRacers, a real treat for all the fans of the series! An immense space that combines the mysterious charm of a gigantic cave with state-of-the-art technological solutions, featuring a holographic Wheel of Power at its center, dominating the scene.

Explore all the secrets of this new environment aboard Rat-ified™, the powerful rat-rod of the Metal Maniacs, Chicane™, the high-tech muscle car of the Teku team, Spine Buster™, the roaring supercar of Mark Wylde, or Vert’s, the high-performance car of the legendary Vert Wheeler.

Don't miss the AcceleRacers Expansion Pack and build a track worthy of the World Race!

This DLC includes:
- 1 Environment to build your tracks: AcceleDrome;
- 4 Vehicles: Rat-ified™, Chicane™, Spine Buster™, Vert’s; 
- 1 new area to add to the Hot Wheels™ Creature Rampage mode;
- Background, Profile icon, Tag and Card Background to further customize your Unleashed Profile!

This DLC is included in the HOT WHEELS UNLEASHED™ 2 - Season Pass Vol. 1.

70050000043321.description:
A small village on the most characteristic Italian coastline, where the days pass slowly, strolling through narrow alleys, and enjoying a sunny lunch on the terrace... is about to be shaken by the adrenaline-fueled excitement of the craziest races ever! Meet in the square to kick off the show and discover the hidden corners of this wonderful Italian village, with its restaurants, shops, and the church bell tower.

Experience the thrills of racing behind the wheel of Italian-made speedsters like the Alfa Romeo 155 V6 TI and Lancia 037, or choose to enjoy the Dolce Vita aboard the legendary Fiat 500D Modificado or the iconic Vespa 90 SS Super Sprint (1966).

Among roof tiles, bricks, and stones, get ready to show everyone what you're made of with the Made in Italy Expansion Pack!

This DLC includes:
- 1 Environment to build your tracks: Italian Village;
- 4 Vehicles: Alfa Romeo 155 V6 TI, Lancia 037, Fiat 500D Modificado, Vespa 90 SS Super Sprint (1966);
- 1 new area to add to the Hot Wheels™ Creature Rampage mode;
- Background, Profile icon, Tag and Card Background to further customize your Unleashed Profile!

This DLC is included in the HOT WHEELS UNLEASHED™ 2 - Season Pass Vol. 1.

70050000046140.description:
Introduce a bit of spookiness to the party!
Spooky Hamster House DLC is the expansion pack for Hamster Playground – a fresh dash of content to enrich your experience! Our hamsters are keen on celebrating social events and they are more than ready to dip their paws into the foggy waters of unknown and scary.
Help them by redecorating their house in a spooky way and dressing them up in new costumes that would not be out of place at a zombie prom! Complete fresh quests and experience a new, deliciously witchy hamster job.

Spooky Hamster House DLC features:
new, spooky items for the hamster house;
new, scary costumes;
brand-new quests with unique rewards;
a super spooky job for your hamsters!

70050000047611.description:
Supporter Pack includes:
• Unique winter camouflage suit "Avalanche", which increases the player's stealth and changes their appearance;
• Flare gun SPSh-44 with cartridges for it;
• ATOM thermos, capable of keeping beverages hot even in the most severe weather;
• ATOM backpack, functional yet roomy;
• Unique color set for special armor "ATOM Fury";
• New location "Airdrop site", where you can find all the items included in the set. ATOM does not forget its best agents and always aims to support them with resources and ammunition!

70050000047612.description:
War Supply Pack includes:
• Shooting knife NRS-2 with cartridges for it;
• Portable press for creating cartridges;
• ATOM parade uniform;
• Unique special armor color set “Red Dawn”;
• New location "Crashed Plane", where you will find these interesting and useful items.

70050000047872.description:
Our story begins when Mont and little Yun leave for XiangYang City in search of Yun's missing mother. But before they reach their destination the Rewinders take shelter in a nearby town – Liu Village. As it happens, the strange activities of the village make our protagonist uneasy…

Why are all of the villagers meditating? What is the meaning of their strange ceremonies? When the night comes and the moon rises in the sky, the true story of Liu Village will reveal itself.

Nothing like the fledgling Yun's journey, how will the accomplished Rewinder Master Mont approach this dangerous mystery?


More content details:
Brand new storyline;
Unique puzzle-combat system;
Increased freedom in memory level;
Over 4 possible unique endings.

70070000015782.description:
Relax and chill by coloring your world! 
With this bundle you will never run out of pictures to fill!

Featuring:
* Calm Colors - fill 200 beautiful illustrations solo or with friends;
* Love Colors - paint by numbers game with 150+ pictures to color;
* Stencil Art - place a stencil and spray to paint awesome pictures;
* Logic Pic - solve 1000+ puzzles to discover pixel images in single- and multiplayer modes.

Place colorful shapes, solve pixel art puzzles and enjoy beautiful images!

70070000015993.description:
Do you need to chill and blow off some steam? These three games are exactly what you need! Our Pocket Bundle will provide many hours of fun solo or with your frienemies!

The Bundle includes:
- Pocket Mini Golf: a hit with over half a milion downloads, it mixes classic golf gameplay with crazy obstacles;
- Pocket Mini Golf 2: a sequel to surpass the original, it lets you explore 4 worlds and 5 game modes with customables and trophies;
- Pocket Pool: this game is bonkers and it is a banana... or a pirate ship. Or a watermelon. Relax at our new cool pool!

It's time to chill and show off your skill! This is the bundle you were looking for!

70070000016119.description:
Venture with CommanderVideo on incredible journey through 8-bit classics! Experience various game modes and controlls inspired by retro arcade games, and win each level with epic beat in the background! Now in a 6-in-1 bundle!

The Collection features:
- 120 unique rhythmic levels;
- soul-touching pixel art and atmoshpere;
- synesthetic music/art/gameplay interaction;
- hyper-realistic retro cutscenes!

Arcade adventure awaits!

70070000017080.description:
IIN - You are a soul who controls cubes, overcoming challenges to open and enter the portals, your true goal;
• You can play as a singleplayer or with two players coop locally;
• 80 challenges for you to overcome;

Goroons -  it's a game about cooperation, communication, and cute monsters with unique abilities!
• Four Cute monsters with unique skills that you can control with up to 4 players locally
• 65 challenges for you to overcome;

Both
• Ranking globally your performance at each level for all the world see;

• Special Challenge when each 15 days you receive a new bundle of challenges to test your performance and show in the globally ranking

70070000021306.description:
Features:
- 80 levels;
- Original soundtrack;
- Satisfactory puzzles;
- Low poly;

Developer Colossus Game Studio 
