70070000025784.description:
Experience the ultimate Wild West showdown with the Deluxe Edition!

This all-in-one bundle includes the main game and all DLCs: 
-Western Duo, bringing two fearless cowboys; 
-Killer Guns, adding powerful new weapons; 
-DeadShot Alliance, introducing a new ally; 
-Gold Rush, packed with riches to fuel your fight. 

Saddle up, gear up, and take on the undead frontier like never before!

70070000026139.description:
An engaging racing game, a thrilling experiencing aboard fast formula cars plus 20 different liveries to chose from, all bundled together!
ALA MOBILE offers the following features:
-16 different racetracks from real world;
-10 different cars, each one with its pros and cons;
-Free practices, qualifying and compelling races;
-Pitstops, 5 tires compounds and fully customizable setup;
-Online head to head races;
-Different weather conditions;
-Safety car interventions;
-Complete livery and helmet editors;
-Damages and penalties;
-Amazing on-track action!
Bundled with the game, you will also get the VARIANTE Livery bundle, which includes a new, shiny, livery for each car!
What are you waiting for? Wear your helmet and get to track now!
